01:22:01.660 --> 01:22:07.259
Uh, there are territorial rights by law with A&M of certain service areas

01:22:07.259 --> 01:22:08.580
for water utilities.

01:22:09.020 --> 01:22:11.620
So you will see within the city limits of Huntsville,

01:22:11.740 --> 01:22:13.060
um, we have.

01:22:13.479 --> 01:22:16.350
Uh, the majority I would say is served by Huntsville utilities.

01:22:16.390 --> 01:22:19.919
