01:22:42.740 --> 01:22:47.000
Uh, we want that franchise such that they will relocate their utilities

01:22:47.279 --> 01:22:48.419
at their cost.

01:22:48.620 --> 01:22:54.060
Uh, so that's what this is doing is, uh, as we've annexed south of I-565

01:22:54.060 --> 01:22:57.279
in the rapidly growing Swancott Road Area District 5,

01:22:57.600 --> 01:23:01.459
we need to, uh, provide Limestone County Water and Sewer Authority,

01:23:01.779 --> 01:23:06.020
