01:42:14.669 --> 01:42:19.549
Um, our journey began May 13, 2023 when our son Trey experienced an eight

01:42:19.549 --> 01:42:21.189
hour nosebleed that would not stop.

01:42:21.779 --> 01:42:25.549
That frightening two day hospital uh stay ended with a blood transfusion

01:42:25.549 --> 01:42:28.830
that he had to receive, and it was through that medical emergency that we

01:42:28.830 --> 01:42:32.629
learned that he has hemophilia, a rare inherited bleeding disorder.

01:42:33.069 --> 01:42:35.540
Um, as our family underwent additional testing,

01:42:35.589 --> 01:42:39.310
we discovered that our youngest son Cairo also inherited the hemophilia

01:42:39.310 --> 01:42:43.589
mutation, and our youngest daughter Amaya is a carrier of the hemophilia

01:42:43.589 --> 01:42:43.990
trait.

01:42:44.560 --> 01:42:48.040
And what felt like a single moment changed our lives forever.

01:42:48.359 --> 01:42:50.189
We found ourselves searching for answers,

01:42:50.479 --> 01:42:54.140
resources, and a community that truly understood what our family was experiencing.

01:42:54.799 --> 01:42:58.040
Um, so their journey inspired us to create We Feel Foundation so that no

01:42:58.040 --> 01:42:59.660
family has to face that path alone.

01:43:00.319 --> 01:43:03.080
Um, our motto is simple we care, we fight,

01:43:03.160 --> 01:43:03.620
we feel.

01:43:04.200 --> 01:43:07.680
